#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this section, we walk through the four steps of the Qiskit pattern on a "
"seven-qubit instance of the labeling-cosets-with-error problem and evaluate "
"a single kernel matrix entry using the `StatevectorSampler` primitive from "
"Qiskit. A statevector simulator is exact (up to shot noise) and shows us the"
" method end-to-end without consuming QPU time. We then repeat the same "
"instance on real hardware in the hardware example section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam bahagian ini, kita berjalan melalui empat langkah corak Qiskit pada "
"contoh tujuh-qubit masalah pelabelan-koset-dengan-ralat dan menilai satu "
"entri matriks kernel menggunakan primitif `StatevectorSampler` dari Qiskit. "
"Simulator statevector adalah tepat (sehingga bunyi tembakan) dan menunjukkan"
" kepada kita kaedah dari awal hingga akhir tanpa menggunakan masa QPU. Kita "
"kemudian mengulangi contoh yang sama pada perkakasan sebenar dalam bahagian "
"contoh perkakasan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik kepada masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-"
"classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Input: Training dataset.\n"
msgstr "Input: Dataset latihan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Output: Abstract circuit for calculating a kernel matrix entry.\n"
msgstr "Output: Circuit abstrak untuk mengira entri matriks kernel.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The binary classification problem we aim to solve here is referred to as \"[_labeling cosets with error_](https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.03406).\" The input training dataset contains a group structure, consisting of two cosets formed by a group and subgroup.\n"
"The group is taken to be $G = SU(2)^{\\otimes n}$ for qubits, which is the special unitary group of\n"
"$2 \\times 2$ matrices and has wide applicability in nature; e.g., the Standard Model of particle physics.\n"
"We take the (graph-stabilizer) subgroup $S_\\text{graph} < G$ with $S_\\text{graph} = \\langle \\{ X_i \\otimes _{k:(k,i) \\in \\mathcal{E}} Z_k\\} _{i \\in \\mathcal{V}} \\} \\rangle$ for a graph with edges $\\mathcal{E}$ and vertices $\\mathcal{V}$.\n"
"Note that the stabilizers fix a stabilizer state such that $D_s | \\psi \\rangle = | \\psi \\rangle,~ \\forall s \\in S_\\text{graph}$.\n"
"Finally, we define two left-cosets $C_\\pm = c_\\pm S_\\text{graph}$ by drawing two $c_\\pm \\in G$ at random.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masalah pengelasan binari yang kita cuba selesaikan di sini dirujuk sebagai \"[_pelabelan koset dengan ralat_](https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.03406).\" Dataset latihan input mengandungi struktur kumpulan, terdiri daripada dua koset yang dibentuk oleh kumpulan dan subkumpulan.\n"
"Kumpulan tersebut diambil sebagai $G = SU(2)^{\\otimes n}$ untuk qubit, iaitu kumpulan unit istimewa daripada\n"
"matriks $2 \\times 2$ dan mempunyai kebolehgunaan yang luas dalam alam semula jadi; contohnya, Model Standard fizik zarah.\n"
"Kita mengambil subkumpulan (penstabil-graf) $S_\\text{graph} < G$ dengan $S_\\text{graph} = \\langle \\{ X_i \\otimes _{k:(k,i) \\in \\mathcal{E}} Z_k\\} _{i \\in \\mathcal{V}} \\} \\rangle$ untuk graf dengan tepi $\\mathcal{E}$ dan bucu $\\mathcal{V}$.\n"
"Perhatikan bahawa penstabil menetapkan keadaan penstabil supaya $D_s | \\psi \\rangle = | \\psi \\rangle,~ \\forall s \\in S_\\text{graph}$.\n"
"Akhirnya, kita mentakrifkan dua koset kiri $C_\\pm = c_\\pm S_\\text{graph}$ dengan mengambil dua $c_\\pm \\in G$ secara rawak.\n"

